  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tablespoon of cooking oil in a claypot over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger, cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the fish sauce, sugar, and red pepper flakes, cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the catfish fillets, cook for 2-3 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "Add the sesame butter, bean sprouts, and chopped cilantro/scallions (if using), stir to combine.",
    "Pour in the lime juice, stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low, simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Serve warm, garnished with additional cilantro/scallions (if desired).",
    "Shape each catfish fillet into a small rectangle, resembling a mini banh mi.",
    "Repeat with the remaining ingredients, forming a total of 4 catfish rectangles.",
    "Serve immediately, with warm sesame butter and bean sprouts spooned over the top."
